1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 19=

2
00:01:09,420 --> 00:01:11,860
- Xiaozhu, this is...
- Hello, I'm Lv Mengde.

3
00:01:19,060 --> 00:01:21,420
Miss Mei, are you also a student
at Mintong Middle School?

4
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:22,380
We're in the same class.

5
00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:23,180
She's a top student.

6
00:01:23,180 --> 00:01:24,420
She'll graduate next year.

7
00:01:25,260 --> 00:01:26,900
Come, sit down and chat.

8
00:01:29,220 --> 00:01:30,460
Stay a while.

9
00:01:34,380 --> 00:01:36,740
What would you like to do
after graduation, Miss Mei?

10
00:01:37,020 --> 00:01:38,060
She wants to go to France.

11
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:39,420
She even wants to
become a chief justice.

12
00:01:40,340 --> 00:01:42,140
A young girl aspiring
to be a chief justice?

13
00:01:42,180 --> 00:01:43,620
That's quite ambitious.

14
00:01:45,620 --> 00:01:47,220
You've certainly met the right people.

15
00:01:47,220 --> 00:01:48,740
We have plenty of connections.

16
00:01:48,740 --> 00:01:49,780
Once you graduate,

17
00:01:49,820 --> 00:01:51,260
we can help you find a good job.

18
00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:52,420
Right, Boss Lv?

19
00:01:52,820 --> 00:01:54,500
If there's anything you need, Miss Mei,

20
00:01:54,820 --> 00:01:55,780
just let us know.

21
00:01:56,420 --> 00:01:57,380
It's getting late.

22
00:01:57,420 --> 00:01:58,420
I should go home.

23
00:02:00,220 --> 00:02:01,100
But you just got here.

24
00:02:01,140 --> 00:02:02,500
You haven't even settled in.

25
00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:03,700
Take care, Miss Mei.

26
00:02:03,820 --> 00:02:04,780
Come visit us again sometime.

27
00:02:05,420 --> 00:02:06,180
I'm leaving.

28
00:02:06,180 --> 00:02:06,860
Xiaozhu.

29
00:02:09,220 --> 00:02:10,220
You all carry on drinking.

30
00:02:10,220 --> 00:02:11,300
I'll see her out.

31
00:02:27,220 --> 00:02:28,020
Mengde.

32
00:02:29,180 --> 00:02:30,820
It seems she's not really your friend.

33
00:02:31,420 --> 00:02:32,180
That's not true.

34
00:02:32,180 --> 00:02:33,660
We're very close.

35
00:02:35,940 --> 00:02:37,500
You want to be my wife, don't you?

36
00:02:38,220 --> 00:02:39,860
If you can't handle
a situation like this,

37
00:02:40,220 --> 00:02:41,140
that's going to be a problem.

38
00:02:42,140 --> 00:02:42,940
Don't you think?

39
00:02:45,540 --> 00:02:47,660
Yes, I understand.

40
00:02:49,860 --> 00:02:51,700
Xiaozhu, I'll walk you out.

41
00:02:51,700 --> 00:02:52,420
No need.

42
00:02:53,620 --> 00:02:55,260
What? Don't you remember me?

43
00:02:56,420 --> 00:02:58,700
Yuhe made a qipao for me before.

44
00:02:59,020 --> 00:02:59,940
We met

45
00:03:00,060 --> 00:03:01,220
at her shop.

46
00:03:02,340 --> 00:03:03,340
That's a different matter.

47
00:03:03,740 --> 00:03:04,660
I saw you

48
00:03:05,620 --> 00:03:06,660
with Lv Mengde.

49
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:08,260
He's seeing two women at once.

50
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:13,060
What you saw
isn't necessarily the truth.

51
00:03:13,620 --> 00:03:14,420
What do you mean?

52
00:03:14,660 --> 00:03:15,540
I know

53
00:03:16,380 --> 00:03:17,780
you're worried about your friend

54
00:03:18,380 --> 00:03:19,740
and don't want them together.

55
00:03:20,100 --> 00:03:20,900
As it happens,

56
00:03:21,180 --> 00:03:22,740
I don't want them together either.

57
00:03:24,020 --> 00:03:25,220
What are you trying to say?

58
00:03:25,820 --> 00:03:26,660
How about this?

59
00:03:26,980 --> 00:03:29,180
Come see me tomorrow during the day.

60
00:03:29,620 --> 00:03:30,860
I can tell you

61
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:33,500
how to help Ding Yiyi leave Lv Mengde.

62
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:34,700
(To be honest,)

63
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:36,540
(I didn't trust this woman.)

64
00:03:36,820 --> 00:03:38,020
(But whenever I thought)

65
00:03:38,180 --> 00:03:40,500
(of Lv Mengde's slick, smug appearance,)

66
00:03:40,820 --> 00:03:42,220
(I felt sick.)

67
00:03:42,420 --> 00:03:43,220
(I figured)

68
00:03:43,580 --> 00:03:44,740
(there was no harm)

69
00:03:45,140 --> 00:03:46,460
(in hearing her out.)

70
00:03:46,820 --> 00:03:47,700
Miss Lisa.

71
00:03:48,020 --> 00:03:49,180
Please tell me.

72
00:03:50,820 --> 00:03:52,820
I suggest you take a sip first

73
00:03:52,860 --> 00:03:53,700
to steady your nerves.

74
00:03:53,980 --> 00:03:55,500
What I'm about to tell you

75
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:57,300
isn't going to be pleasant.

76
00:04:06,660 --> 00:04:07,580
Don't worry.

77
00:04:07,620 --> 00:04:08,980
Your sister and I are friends.

78
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:11,780
Why would I want to hurt you?

79
00:04:31,660 --> 00:04:32,540
What are you doing?

80
00:04:32,540 --> 00:04:33,860
I haven't even finished my drink.

81
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:35,660
You can't keep coming
to places like this.

82
00:04:37,020 --> 00:04:38,100
What's gotten into you?

83
00:04:38,180 --> 00:04:39,340
Break up with Lv Mengde,

84
00:04:39,540 --> 00:04:40,620
or I'll tell your brother.

85
00:04:40,820 --> 00:04:42,100
What's wrong with you?

86
00:04:42,660 --> 00:04:44,180
He's not a good man.

87
00:04:44,340 --> 00:04:45,180
If you stay with him,

88
00:04:45,180 --> 00:04:46,020
you'll only neglect your studies.

89
00:04:46,020 --> 00:04:47,020
What good could possibly come of it?

90
00:04:47,020 --> 00:04:48,380
He's willing to spend money on me.

91
00:04:48,660 --> 00:04:49,580
He takes me to fancy restaurants,

92
00:04:49,580 --> 00:04:50,220
buys me beautiful clothes,

93
00:04:50,220 --> 00:04:51,020
and shows me the world.

94
00:04:51,020 --> 00:04:52,020
He loves me.

95
00:04:52,020 --> 00:04:53,220
That's not love.

96
00:04:53,220 --> 00:04:54,620
What do you know about love?

97
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:56,700
Do you think you know him
better than I do?

98
00:04:56,780 --> 00:04:57,820
You don't know anything,

99
00:04:57,820 --> 00:04:59,340
so stop telling me what to do.

100
00:04:59,340 --> 00:04:59,860
Yiyi.

101
00:04:59,860 --> 00:05:00,780
Lv Mengde is...

102
00:05:02,260 --> 00:05:03,220
I'm telling you,

103
00:05:03,220 --> 00:05:05,180
don't say another bad word about him.

104
00:05:06,140 --> 00:05:07,180
Not a single word!

105
00:05:07,540 --> 00:05:08,340
Yiyi!

106
00:05:09,180 --> 00:05:10,100
(During that time,)

107
00:05:10,620 --> 00:05:12,180
(Xiaozhu and I often argued.)

108
00:05:13,060 --> 00:05:14,340
(She kept trying to stop me)

109
00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:15,900
(and force me to break up with Mengde.)

110
00:05:16,220 --> 00:05:17,380
You're just putting a curse on me.

111
00:05:17,410 --> 00:05:18,340
You're cursing me!

112
00:05:18,780 --> 00:05:20,300
So much for making me that red bracelet.

113
00:05:20,340 --> 00:05:22,100
So much for wishing me happiness.

114
00:05:25,580 --> 00:05:26,740
You're just jealous of me!

115
00:05:28,460 --> 00:05:29,300
(And just like that,)

116
00:05:30,060 --> 00:05:31,580
(Xiaozhu and I stopped
seeing each other.)

117
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:35,420
What about Yijie?

118
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:38,540
How did he get involved?

119
00:05:39,420 --> 00:05:40,220
What?

120
00:05:40,460 --> 00:05:41,500
How much do you need to borrow?

121
00:05:41,740 --> 00:05:42,580
Eight hundred.

122
00:05:42,980 --> 00:05:43,700
Do you have that much?

123
00:05:44,540 --> 00:05:45,620
My family may be wealthy,

124
00:05:45,620 --> 00:05:46,860
but I'm just a student.

125
00:05:47,260 --> 00:05:48,660
How could I have that much money?

126
00:05:51,740 --> 00:05:52,540
Xiaozhu.

127
00:05:53,180 --> 00:05:54,660
Are you in some kind of trouble?

128
00:05:55,060 --> 00:05:56,420
Why do you suddenly need so much money?

129
00:05:57,380 --> 00:05:58,220
It's not for me.

130
00:05:58,590 --> 00:05:59,540
It's for Yiyi.

131
00:06:00,020 --> 00:06:00,940
What happened to her?

132
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:07,660
She's seeing someone.

133
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:10,780
He's spent quite a bit of money on her.

134
00:06:11,380 --> 00:06:13,260
I heard from a singer at Kaimeili

135
00:06:13,860 --> 00:06:15,820
that unless Yiyi earns that money back

136
00:06:15,820 --> 00:06:17,020
or pays them back,

137
00:06:18,420 --> 00:06:19,220
she won't be allowed

138
00:06:19,620 --> 00:06:21,260
to leave Kaimeili.

139
00:06:21,740 --> 00:06:22,620
Kaimeili?

140
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:24,420
What were you doing
at a place like that?

141
00:06:24,620 --> 00:06:25,900
You don't need to get involved.

142
00:06:26,140 --> 00:06:27,140
If you don't have the money to lend me,

143
00:06:27,140 --> 00:06:28,340
I'll find another way.

144
00:06:28,340 --> 00:06:29,140
You expect me to stay out of it?

145
00:06:29,940 --> 00:06:31,380
What can you do about it anyway?

146
00:06:31,860 --> 00:06:33,740
Besides, does Ding Yiyi
even want your help?

147
00:06:33,990 --> 00:06:35,620
Yiyi isn't thinking clearly.

148
00:06:35,620 --> 00:06:37,060
She can't make good decisions.

149
00:06:37,860 --> 00:06:39,260
I'm her good friend.

150
00:06:39,540 --> 00:06:40,900
I can't pretend
I don't know what's happening

151
00:06:41,620 --> 00:06:43,180
or just watch her get trapped, can I?

152
00:06:43,180 --> 00:06:44,700
But that's her own choice.

153
00:06:45,020 --> 00:06:46,300
What does it have to do with you?

154
00:06:48,820 --> 00:06:51,060
Do you think the singers
and dance hostesses at dance halls,

155
00:06:51,180 --> 00:06:52,940
the beggars and orphans on the streets,

156
00:06:52,940 --> 00:06:53,620
all chose

157
00:06:53,620 --> 00:06:55,100
to live that way?

158
00:06:55,860 --> 00:06:57,180
What about my sister and me?

159
00:06:57,980 --> 00:06:59,460
Do you think we chose

160
00:06:59,460 --> 00:07:00,700
to be abandoned by our family

161
00:07:00,740 --> 00:07:02,500
and live in poverty in the slums?

162
00:07:03,380 --> 00:07:03,900
Xiaozhu.

163
00:07:03,900 --> 00:07:04,940
You're a wealthy young master.

164
00:07:05,420 --> 00:07:06,380
You don't understand.

165
00:07:07,180 --> 00:07:07,820
Some people

166
00:07:08,140 --> 00:07:09,820
are physically trapped
in their circumstances.

167
00:07:10,580 --> 00:07:12,260
Others are trapped by their own beliefs.

168
00:07:13,420 --> 00:07:14,220
Right now,

169
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:16,660
Yiyi is trapped by both.

170
00:07:17,220 --> 00:07:19,020
No one in this world will save her.

171
00:07:19,620 --> 00:07:22,100
They'd rather watch her
sink deeper into despair.

172
00:07:23,020 --> 00:07:24,100
But she's my friend.

173
00:07:24,540 --> 00:07:25,820
I can't just abandon her.

174
00:07:26,420 --> 00:07:27,220
Besides,

175
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:30,460
I'm afraid Yiyi isn't the only victim.

176
00:07:33,020 --> 00:07:33,980
What do you mean?

177
00:07:33,980 --> 00:07:35,180
I've been watching for a long time.

178
00:07:35,660 --> 00:07:37,780
There are many con artists at Kaimeili.

179
00:07:37,820 --> 00:07:39,980
They surround girls
and charm them with sweet words.

180
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:42,620
The girls fall for their flattery

181
00:07:42,620 --> 00:07:44,060
and begin relationships with them.

182
00:07:44,310 --> 00:07:47,180
Then, on those girls,

183
00:07:47,180 --> 00:07:48,740
a black cat design appears.

184
00:07:48,980 --> 00:07:50,020
A black cat design?

185
00:07:50,660 --> 00:07:51,820
That's why I think

186
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:53,900
there's more to this than just romance.

187
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:55,820
Then you have even more
reason to stay out of it.

188
00:07:55,820 --> 00:07:57,220
I don't care about
the state of the world

189
00:07:57,380 --> 00:07:58,660
or what happens to other people.

190
00:07:58,660 --> 00:07:59,980
I only care about keeping you safe.

191
00:08:00,980 --> 00:08:01,780
Yijie.

192
00:08:04,540 --> 00:08:05,580
Do you remember

193
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,460
what I told you my dream was?

194
00:08:08,820 --> 00:08:09,620
I remember.

195
00:08:10,660 --> 00:08:12,020
You said you wanted
to become a chief justice.

196
00:08:12,460 --> 00:08:14,100
But the job itself isn't what matters.

197
00:08:14,740 --> 00:08:16,940
It's just a way for me
to achieve my dream.

198
00:08:17,340 --> 00:08:18,290
What I really want

199
00:08:18,430 --> 00:08:19,540
is for all of us

200
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,660
to live in a more peaceful,

201
00:08:21,780 --> 00:08:24,140
safer, and fairer society.

202
00:08:24,820 --> 00:08:25,860
But right now,

203
00:08:26,140 --> 00:08:28,180
Yiyi and those girls are in danger.

204
00:08:28,220 --> 00:08:29,740
If I turn a blind eye,

205
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:31,540
I'd be betraying
everything I believe in.

206
00:08:32,140 --> 00:08:32,940
Xiaozhu.

207
00:08:33,420 --> 00:08:34,220
Yijie.

208
00:08:34,380 --> 00:08:35,660
I don't want to wait until I'm grown up

209
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:37,100
to start pursuing that dream.

210
00:08:37,420 --> 00:08:39,180
I want to start working toward it now.

211
00:08:39,380 --> 00:08:40,180
But...

212
00:08:40,420 --> 00:08:41,820
I've already made up my mind.

213
00:08:45,980 --> 00:08:46,780
All right.

214
00:08:47,820 --> 00:08:48,860
Whatever you want to do,

215
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:50,660
I'll help you.

216
00:08:55,740 --> 00:08:56,780
Happy birthday.

217
00:08:57,460 --> 00:08:59,660
- Happy birthday, Boss Lv.
- Happy birthday, Boss Lv.

218
00:08:59,660 --> 00:09:00,940
Thank you. Let's go.

219
00:09:00,940 --> 00:09:02,220
Come on, let's go.

220
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:10,580
I'll ask you one last time.

221
00:09:11,060 --> 00:09:12,460
Are you sure you want to do this?

222
00:09:13,180 --> 00:09:14,620
Lv Mengde is our uncle, after all.

223
00:09:16,580 --> 00:09:18,180
He's the leader of those con artists.

224
00:09:18,860 --> 00:09:19,980
Only by getting close to him

225
00:09:20,180 --> 00:09:21,660
can we get hold of that register.

226
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,400
(Kaimeili)

227
00:09:26,500 --> 00:09:30,820
- Everyone, wish Boss Lv a happy birthday!
- Happy birthday!

228
00:09:31,460 --> 00:09:32,220
Thank you!

229
00:09:32,220 --> 00:09:33,020
Come on, everyone! Cheers!

230
00:09:33,020 --> 00:09:33,940
Cheers!

231
00:09:38,660 --> 00:09:39,940
Sit down. Find yourselves a seat.

232
00:09:39,940 --> 00:09:41,060
I'll come find you in a little while.

233
00:09:44,060 --> 00:09:44,900
Boss Lv.

234
00:09:45,780 --> 00:09:46,460
Miss Mei.

235
00:09:46,460 --> 00:09:47,380
Happy birthday.

236
00:09:48,420 --> 00:09:49,580
What brings you here?

237
00:09:49,780 --> 00:09:50,580
And you're...

238
00:09:50,580 --> 00:09:51,660
It's Boss Lv's birthday.

239
00:09:51,660 --> 00:09:52,980
Of course I had to come celebrate.

240
00:09:53,700 --> 00:09:55,700
I'm still counting on you
to help me get ahead.

241
00:10:08,860 --> 00:10:10,780
No wonder you're a top student
with a scholarship.

242
00:10:11,100 --> 00:10:11,860
Perfect timing.

243
00:10:11,860 --> 00:10:13,500
Some friends from France are here today.

244
00:10:13,500 --> 00:10:14,260
Let me introduce you to them.

245
00:10:14,260 --> 00:10:14,940
Come on.

246
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:20,460
Young Master Kuang got into
trouble because of Xiaozhu,

247
00:10:21,260 --> 00:10:23,180
and Xiaozhu got into
trouble because of me.

248
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:25,700
Mrs. Kuang.

249
00:10:27,030 --> 00:10:28,040
Don't you blame me?

250
00:10:29,020 --> 00:10:30,380
For Yijie's death

251
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,420
and Xiaozhu's death?

252
00:10:33,970 --> 00:10:35,060
Wasn't Lv Mengde

253
00:10:35,060 --> 00:10:36,740
the one who caused all this?

254
00:10:37,220 --> 00:10:38,980
He's the one we should hate.

255
00:10:40,860 --> 00:10:42,180
Miss Mei.

256
00:10:42,820 --> 00:10:44,380
How interesting.

257
00:10:44,700 --> 00:10:46,580
You approached me
willingly to save Ding Yiyi.

258
00:10:46,860 --> 00:10:47,700
What's this?

259
00:10:47,700 --> 00:10:48,860
Such devotion between friends?

260
00:10:50,860 --> 00:10:52,180
I don't know what you're talking about.

261
00:10:52,860 --> 00:10:53,820
Let go of me.

262
00:10:53,940 --> 00:10:54,740
Fine.

263
00:10:55,460 --> 00:10:57,020
I can leave Ding Yiyi alone.

264
00:10:58,220 --> 00:11:00,900
But you'll have to do something for me.

265
00:11:01,060 --> 00:11:01,860
What is it?

266
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:05,260
I'll tell you

267
00:11:05,260 --> 00:11:06,420
when I've decided.

268
00:11:08,260 --> 00:11:09,420
However,

269
00:11:10,300 --> 00:11:12,300
you know debts must be settled
before anyone leaves, right?

270
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:14,100
That was money you spent

271
00:11:14,100 --> 00:11:15,060
to deceive Ding Yiyi.

272
00:11:15,260 --> 00:11:16,260
She doesn't owe you anything.

273
00:11:16,260 --> 00:11:17,060
Does that matter?

274
00:11:27,860 --> 00:11:30,140
If she leaves, the debt becomes yours.

275
00:11:30,460 --> 00:11:31,580
Don't even think about running away.

276
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:33,070
Otherwise, by the time we're done,

277
00:11:33,070 --> 00:11:34,980
one debt will become two or three.

278
00:11:35,260 --> 00:11:35,900
With interest piling up,

279
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:37,340
you'll never be able to pay it off.

280
00:11:39,260 --> 00:11:40,180
Or perhaps

281
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:42,100
you could do what Ding Yiyi did

282
00:11:43,060 --> 00:11:44,380
and have your sister pay it for you.

283
00:11:44,380 --> 00:11:45,020
You...

284
00:11:49,180 --> 00:11:49,980
I'm off.

285
00:12:01,060 --> 00:12:01,860
What's wrong?

286
00:12:02,660 --> 00:12:04,090
You got what you wanted.

287
00:12:04,620 --> 00:12:05,940
Shouldn't you be happy?

288
00:12:06,860 --> 00:12:07,660
It was you.

289
00:12:08,100 --> 00:12:09,420
You were the one who told Lv Mengde.

290
00:12:09,900 --> 00:12:11,180
You set me up and deceived me.

291
00:12:13,260 --> 00:12:14,620
I was helping you.

292
00:12:14,940 --> 00:12:15,740
Look.

293
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:17,700
By walking right into our hands,

294
00:12:18,060 --> 00:12:19,700
didn't you save Ding Yiyi?

295
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:22,740
Whether she's grateful to you

296
00:12:22,860 --> 00:12:24,020
or hates you for it,

297
00:12:24,420 --> 00:12:25,660
I wouldn't know.

298
00:12:25,780 --> 00:12:26,980
Why did you do this?

299
00:12:28,060 --> 00:12:29,700
Because I'm jealous, of course.

300
00:12:30,820 --> 00:12:31,740
I'm so jealous

301
00:12:31,740 --> 00:12:33,940
that she has a friend like you
who cares enough to interfere.

302
00:12:34,820 --> 00:12:35,700
Unlike me,

303
00:12:36,420 --> 00:12:38,260
when I needed help the most,

304
00:12:39,110 --> 00:12:40,780
no one stood up for me.

305
00:12:41,580 --> 00:12:43,420
No one took me away.

306
00:12:45,580 --> 00:12:46,540
You have no idea.

307
00:12:47,060 --> 00:12:49,580
Whenever I see innocent young girls
like you,

308
00:12:49,580 --> 00:12:51,300
it makes me feel miserable.

309
00:12:53,260 --> 00:12:54,300
But now that's changed.

310
00:12:56,660 --> 00:12:57,460
Xiaozhu.

311
00:12:58,980 --> 00:13:01,820
Welcome to hell.

312
00:13:06,620 --> 00:13:07,460
What do you mean?

313
00:13:08,060 --> 00:13:10,300
Debt, drug addiction,

314
00:13:11,620 --> 00:13:12,420
and then...

315
00:13:13,580 --> 00:13:14,540
What do you think?

316
00:13:15,420 --> 00:13:17,060
You've already been exposed to it.

317
00:13:18,660 --> 00:13:20,540
You're no longer
in control of your own life.

318
00:13:22,180 --> 00:13:23,740
None of us are.

319
00:13:30,580 --> 00:13:31,780
Stop fighting it.

320
00:13:33,140 --> 00:13:34,860
Ding Yiyi's supposed debt

321
00:13:35,860 --> 00:13:37,860
was nothing but bait to lure you in.

322
00:13:39,580 --> 00:13:41,420
Mengde had his eye on you all along.

323
00:13:42,860 --> 00:13:43,660
None of us

324
00:13:45,270 --> 00:13:46,660
can escape.

325
00:13:57,700 --> 00:13:58,700
It's all my fault.

326
00:13:59,820 --> 00:14:00,820
If I hadn't

327
00:14:00,820 --> 00:14:02,300
ignored Lisa's suffering back then,

328
00:14:03,250 --> 00:14:04,400
none of this would have happened.

329
00:14:07,580 --> 00:14:08,340
Yuhe.

330
00:14:09,780 --> 00:14:10,700
I'm sorry.

331
00:14:11,820 --> 00:14:13,140
How is any of this your fault?

332
00:14:14,100 --> 00:14:15,100
Whether it's Lisa

333
00:14:15,290 --> 00:14:16,220
or Yiyi,

334
00:14:16,980 --> 00:14:19,060
they were all exploited,
just like Xiaozhu.

335
00:14:20,260 --> 00:14:23,220
Fame, fortune, love, justice.

336
00:14:23,860 --> 00:14:24,980
Whatever you desire,

337
00:14:24,980 --> 00:14:26,380
they use it against you.

338
00:14:27,100 --> 00:14:28,500
The ones at fault are those con artists,

339
00:14:28,500 --> 00:14:29,460
not us.

340
00:14:30,860 --> 00:14:32,700
Don't you find it strange?

341
00:14:35,420 --> 00:14:37,740
If Lv Mengde only wanted
to train another cat,

342
00:14:38,180 --> 00:14:40,180
why go to so much trouble?

343
00:14:40,740 --> 00:14:42,140
He set a trap with Lisa

344
00:14:42,340 --> 00:14:43,380
and used Yiyi as well.

345
00:14:43,860 --> 00:14:45,100
That can only mean one thing.

346
00:14:46,060 --> 00:14:49,220
Lv Mengde must have had

347
00:14:49,220 --> 00:14:50,940
a much bigger purpose
in mind for Xiaozhu.

348
00:14:57,620 --> 00:15:01,100
Because Xiaozhu
was Dong Zhenglun's daughter.

349
00:15:02,460 --> 00:15:05,020
So Lv Mengde knew about
their relationship all along

350
00:15:05,860 --> 00:15:08,260
and wanted to stir up
conflict within the Kuang family

351
00:15:08,860 --> 00:15:10,620
so he could reap the benefits.

352
00:15:11,340 --> 00:15:12,140
Exactly.

353
00:15:12,580 --> 00:15:13,860
Dong Zhenglun married
into the Kuang family.

354
00:15:14,460 --> 00:15:15,500
If Mrs. Kuang

355
00:15:15,740 --> 00:15:17,500
found out they had abandoned Xiaozhu,

356
00:15:17,780 --> 00:15:19,460
she would certainly cause an uproar.

357
00:15:20,100 --> 00:15:21,580
Knowing Kuang Jinpeng,

358
00:15:22,180 --> 00:15:24,260
he'd probably make
Dong Zhenglun take the blame.

359
00:15:24,820 --> 00:15:26,020
Once Dong Zhenglun lost his standing,

360
00:15:26,460 --> 00:15:29,260
Kuang Jinpeng would rely even more
on his illegitimate son.

361
00:15:30,260 --> 00:15:33,340
So Lv Mengde introduced
Xiaozhu to Dong Zhenglun

362
00:15:34,300 --> 00:15:36,100
and manipulated him
into killing her to silence her,

363
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:38,540
planning to expose
the scandal afterward.

364
00:15:39,500 --> 00:15:40,740
But he never expected

365
00:15:42,300 --> 00:15:43,700
Xiaozhu to fight back and kill him.

366
00:15:46,060 --> 00:15:47,500
But if that's what happened,

367
00:15:48,820 --> 00:15:50,700
why did Xiaozhu take her own life?

368
00:16:24,280 --> 00:16:28,560
(Cat Training Register)

369
00:16:35,400 --> 00:16:39,080
(Ding Yiyi, Kuang Jinpeng)

370
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:48,120
(Mei Xiaozhu, Dong Zhenglun)

371
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:01,740
Have you lost your mind?

372
00:17:02,100 --> 00:17:04,100
You're going to offer
Mei Xiaozhu to Dong Zhenglun?

373
00:17:04,540 --> 00:17:05,340
What's wrong?

374
00:17:06,420 --> 00:17:07,980
Do you think he won't like this gift?

375
00:17:09,460 --> 00:17:10,580
Don't do anything reckless.

376
00:17:11,260 --> 00:17:12,900
If you ruin our plan
for the end of the month,

377
00:17:13,100 --> 00:17:14,300
we'll both be killed.

378
00:17:14,540 --> 00:17:15,340
Don't worry.

379
00:17:15,780 --> 00:17:16,860
Only if something happens to him

380
00:17:16,860 --> 00:17:17,980
can I rise to power

381
00:17:18,460 --> 00:17:21,140
and do more for you, right?

382
00:17:26,900 --> 00:17:28,220
Come on, let's go.

383
00:18:15,260 --> 00:18:15,860
(Yijie,)

384
00:18:16,580 --> 00:18:17,820
(I'm running out of time.)

385
00:18:18,500 --> 00:18:20,580
(There's something seriously
wrong with my body.)

386
00:18:21,580 --> 00:18:24,580
(I don't know how much longer
I can think clearly.)

387
00:18:25,220 --> 00:18:26,340
(I'm out of options.)

388
00:18:26,980 --> 00:18:28,500
(There's absolutely nothing I can do.)

389
00:18:29,820 --> 00:18:31,660
(This is the only way
I can leave you a message.)

390
00:18:34,700 --> 00:18:37,500
(I know you've angered
Master Kuang recently)

391
00:18:37,500 --> 00:18:38,900
(and can't come out to see me.)

392
00:18:39,460 --> 00:18:40,420
(But that's all right.)

393
00:18:40,660 --> 00:18:42,180
(I'm already close to the truth.)

394
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:46,580
(Tomorrow is the charity ball
at the Paris Hotel.)

395
00:18:47,420 --> 00:18:50,440
- (Lv Mengde said he'd offer me to your father.)
- Is anyone there?

396
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:51,480
Let me out!

397
00:18:51,860 --> 00:18:55,660
- (I think this is my last chance.)
- Grandfather, I was wrong! Please let me out!

398
00:18:57,060 --> 00:18:57,860
(For your sake,)

399
00:18:58,620 --> 00:19:00,060
(I have to meet him.)

400
00:19:00,900 --> 00:19:03,180
(I need to warn him
about Lv Mengde's scheme.)

401
00:19:04,180 --> 00:19:07,300
(I also have to make
one last attempt to save myself.)

402
00:19:08,820 --> 00:19:11,100
(I stole several pages
from Lv Mengde's register.)

403
00:19:11,540 --> 00:19:13,780
(I'll hide them under
the bedboards at our usual place.)

404
00:19:14,300 --> 00:19:17,060
(Once you retrieve them,
make sure you keep them safe.)

405
00:19:18,180 --> 00:19:20,340
(Lv Mengde will probably find out soon.)

406
00:19:21,060 --> 00:19:22,580
(I'm certain to die.)

407
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:25,060
(But I can't let
my death be meaningless.)

408
00:19:26,460 --> 00:19:30,220
(He and Long Feng have
a secret plan for the end of the month.)

409
00:19:30,720 --> 00:19:32,010
(I hope my death)

410
00:19:32,460 --> 00:19:34,540
(can disrupt that plan.)

411
00:19:34,980 --> 00:19:36,900
(Use their suspicions against them)

412
00:19:37,180 --> 00:19:38,180
(and turn them against each other.)

413
00:19:38,620 --> 00:19:39,420
(Avenge me)

414
00:19:40,060 --> 00:19:41,740
(and those girls.)

415
00:19:43,300 --> 00:19:44,540
(And there's my sister.)

416
00:19:45,780 --> 00:19:46,900
(I've let her down.)

417
00:19:48,100 --> 00:19:49,060
(Please)

418
00:19:49,700 --> 00:19:51,020
(take good care of her for me.)

419
00:19:52,260 --> 00:19:53,980
(Our time as brother and sister
in this life has been brief.)

420
00:19:55,100 --> 00:19:57,940
(May we meet again in the next life.)

421
00:19:58,060 --> 00:20:00,090
♪I choose to tear apart♪

422
00:20:00,100 --> 00:20:01,610
♪I choose to pierce through♪

423
00:20:01,620 --> 00:20:02,930
♪Silk and shadows cling to my back♪

424
00:20:02,940 --> 00:20:05,210
♪The hopes I never chose♪

425
00:20:05,260 --> 00:20:07,930
♪The city still shines♪

426
00:20:07,940 --> 00:20:11,920
♪But it doesn't belong to me♪

427
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:15,400
♪I choose to wait♪

428
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:19,010
♪I choose to fall♪

429
00:20:19,020 --> 00:20:21,000
♪They taught me to bow my head♪

430
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:23,200
♪To be beautiful, to be small♪

431
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:26,440
♪Growing within every crack♪

432
00:20:26,440 --> 00:20:28,120
♪Even if I fall♪

433
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:30,090
♪I will fall with my eyes wide open♪

434
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:31,960
♪Never numb♪

435
00:20:31,960 --> 00:20:33,760
♪Never yielding♪

436
00:20:33,770 --> 00:20:37,650
♪I will not beg the world for mercy♪

437
00:20:37,660 --> 00:20:39,530
♪I will stand tall♪

438
00:20:39,530 --> 00:20:41,070
♪And face it♪

439
00:20:41,070 --> 00:20:42,860
♪I light up the darkness♪

440
00:20:42,860 --> 00:20:44,530
♪My hands are no longer bound♪

441
00:20:44,540 --> 00:20:46,580
♪I pray to no god♪

442
00:20:46,590 --> 00:20:51,890
♪I recognize no king♪
